2025-05-20 09:04:14,414 - INFO - Western Europe was the largest region in the management consulting services market in 2024. North America was the second largest region in the management consulting services market. The regions covered in the management consulting services market report are Asia-Pacific, Western Europe, Eastern Europe, North America, South America, Middle East, Africa
