port/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\",\n          \"source_text\": null,\n          \"source_name\": \"The Business Research Company\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"relevant_statistics\": [],\n      \"relevant_data\": [],\n      \"relevant_quotes\": [],\n      \"related_trends\": [\"Cross-border consulting\", \"International joint ventures\"],\n      \"related_mega_trends\": [\"Globalization\", \"Digital connectivity\"],\n      \"possible_signals\": [\"Increased demand for international consulting expertise\"],\n      \"possible_structural_shifts\": [\"Expansion of consulting firms into new geographies\"],\n      \"implications_on_future_of_sector\": [\n        \"Consulting firms must build global networks and expertise.\",\n        \"Clients will expect seamless support across multiple regions.\"\n      ],\n      \"sources\": [\n        {\n          \"title\": \"Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\",\n          \"date\": \"January 2025\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"raw_market_force_id\": \"TBRC-2025-003\",\n      \"raw_market_force_name\": \"Regulatory Reforms and Trade Policy Shifts\",\n      \"raw_description\": \"Rapid changes in trade relations, tariffs, and regulatory reforms\u2014especially in the financial sector\u2014are significantly impacting the management consulting market. These external forces create both challenges and opportunities for consulting firms, as clients seek guidance on compliance, risk management, and adapting to new regulatory environments. The persistence and unpredictability of regulatory shifts require consulting firms to maintain agility and up-to-date expertise.\",\n      \"key_terms\": [\"regulatory reforms\", \"trade policy\", \"tariffs\", \"compliance\", \"risk management\"],\n      \"mentioned_entities\": [\"Accenture\", \"PwC\", \"KPMG\"],\n    