2025-05-20 09:07:57,805 - INFO - MARKET FORCES: [{'source_category': 'Various', 'source_title': 'Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025', 'url': 'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report', 'summary': 'Combined 7 market forces from HTML sources. Processed the Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025 (January 2025) from The Business Research Company. Extracted 7 distinct global market forces affecting management consulting, including technological advancements, globalization, regulatory reforms, digital transformation, environmental collaboration, AI and automation, and evolving client demands. All forces are externally driven, persistent, and have measurable momentum and strategic impact. Major players such as Accenture, PwC, and others are referenced.', 'raw_market_forces': [{'raw_market_force_id': 'TBRC-2025-001', 'raw_market_force_name': 'Technological Advancements and Digital Transformation', 'raw_description': 'Rapid technological advancements, including the adoption of artificial intelligence (AI), automation, Internet of Things (IoT), and quantum computing, are fundamentally reshaping the management consulting sector. These technologies enable consultants to process and analyze massive data sets more efficiently, provide deeper insights, and deliver innovative solutions such as supply chain optimization and digital transformation strategies. The momentum of digital consulting is expected to drive significant market growth, with consulting firms increasingly offering services in digital transformation, cybersecurity, and IT infrastructure. This force is persistent, global, and compels consulting firms to continuously adapt their offerings to remain competitive.', 'key_terms': ['technological advancements', 'digital transformation', 'AI', 'automation', 'IoT', 'quantum computing', 'cybersecurity', 'IT infrastructure'], 'mentioned_entities': ['Accenture', 'NEC Corporation', 'PwC', 'JLL'], 'raw_findings': [{'content': 'Major trends in the forecast period include focus on offering metaverse consulting services, focus on offering internet of things (IoT) in management consulting services, focus on automation and artificial intelligence.', 'source_url': 'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report', 'source_text': None, 'source_name': 'The Business Research Company'}], 'raw_examples': [{'content': 'NEC Corporation launched a new management and business optimization consulting service using AI and quantum computing for supply chain management and production planning.', 'source_url': 'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report', 'source_text': None, 'source_name': 'The Business Research Company'}], 'relevant_facts': [{'content': 'AI and automation help management consultants process and analyze massive amounts of data more efficiently and faster than an average human.', 'source_url': 'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report', 'source_text': None, 'source_name': 'The Business Research Company'}], 'relevant_statistics': [{'content': 'The management consulting services market is expected to grow to $1328.7 billion in 2029 at a CAGR of 5.6%, driven in part by digital consulting.', 'source_url': 'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report', 'source_text': None, 'source_name': 'The Business Research Company'}], 'relevant_data': [], 'relevant_quotes': [{'content': 'AI could add huge value to the management consulting sector, which traditionally was conservative and human-driven. (Euan Cameron, PwC’s UK AI Leader)', 'source_url': 'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report', 'source_text': None, 'source_name': 'The Business Research Company'}], 'related_trends': ['Metaverse consulting', 'IoT in consulting', 'Automation', 'Virtual firms'], 'related_mega_trends': ['Digital transformation', 'AI revolution'], 'possible_signals': ['Increased investment in digital consulting', 'Launch of AI-powered consulting services'], 'possible_structural_shifts': ['Shift from traditional to digital-first consulting models'], 'implications_on_future_of_sector': ['Consulting firms must invest in technology and digital skills to remain relevant.', 'Clients will increasingly demand data-driven, technology-enabled solutions.'], 'sources': [{'title': 'Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025', 'url': 'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report', 'date': 'January 2025'}]}, {'raw_market_force_id': 'TBRC-2025-002', 'raw_market_force_name': 'Globalization and International Expansion', 'raw_description': 'Globalization is driving the need for management consulting services that support international expansion, joint ventures, foreign investments, and multinational operations. As companies expand into high-growth regions, they require sophisticated, internationally oriented consulting services. The momentum of globalization is reinforced by rapid internet growth, automation of consultancy processes, and developments in data security. This force is persistent and compels consulting firms to develop cross-border capabilities and partnerships.', 'key_terms': ['globalization', 'international expansion', 'joint ventures', 'foreign investments', 'multinational companies', 'cross-border consulting'], 'mentioned_entities': ['Accenture', 'PwC', 'KPMG', 'Bain & Company'], 'raw_findings': [{'content': 'Many clients of the management consulting services market are expanding globally and thus require more sophisticated and internationally oriented services.', 'source_url': 'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report', 'source_