s. The momentum of globalization is reinforced by rapid internet growth, automation of consultancy processes, and developments in data security. This force is persistent and compels consulting firms to develop cross-border capabilities and partnerships.\', \'key_terms\': [\'globalization\', \'international expansion\', \'joint ventures\', \'foreign investments\', \'multinational companies\', \'cross-border consulting\'], \'mentioned_entities\': [\'Accenture\', \'PwC\', \'KPMG\', \'Bain & Company\'], \'raw_findings\': [{\'content\': \'Many clients of the management consulting services market are expanding globally and thus require more sophisticated and internationally oriented services.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'raw_examples\': [{\'content\': \'Companies are increasingly forming joint ventures with firms in other countries to test the market or acquire established companies to minimize risk.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'relevant_facts\': [{\'content\': \'Globalization in the management consulting services industry is gaining momentum due to rapid growth in the internet, automation of consultancy processes, and developments in data security.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'relevant_statistics\': [], \'relevant_data\': [], \'relevant_quotes\': [], \'related_trends\': [\'Cross-border consulting\', \'International joint ventures\'], \'related_mega_trends\': [\'Globalization\', \'Digital connectivity\'], \'possible_signals\': [\'Increased demand for int