s, and deliver innovative solutions such as supply chain optimization and digital transformation strategies. The momentum of digital consulting is expected to drive significant market growth, with consulting firms increasingly offering services in digital transformation, cybersecurity, and IT infrastructure. This force is persistent, global, and compels consulting firms to continuously adapt their offerings to remain competitive.\', \'key_terms\': [\'technological advancements\', \'digital transformation\', \'AI\', \'automation\', \'IoT\', \'quantum computing\', \'cybersecurity\', \'IT infrastructure\'], \'mentioned_entities\': [\'Accenture\', \'NEC Corporation\', \'PwC\', \'JLL\'], \'raw_findings\': [{\'content\': \'Major trends in the forecast period include focus on offering metaverse consulting services, focus on offering internet of things (IoT) in management consulting services, focus on automation and artificial intelligence.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'raw_examples\': [{\'content\': \'NEC Corporation launched a new management and business optimization consulting service using AI and quantum computing for supply chain management and production planning.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'relevant_facts\': [{\'content\': \'AI and automation help management consultants process and analyze massive amounts of data more efficiently and faster than an average human.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'relevant_statistics\': [{\'content\': \'The management con