-driven insights and recommendations.\'], \'sources\': [{\'title\': \'Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025\', \'url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'date\': \'January 2025\'}]}, {\'raw_market_force_id\': \'TBRC-2025-007\', \'raw_market_force_name\': \'Economic Growth and Investment in Smart Cities\', \'raw_description\': \'Faster economic growth and increasing investments in smart cities are driving demand for management consulting services. As governments and private entities invest in urban infrastructure and digital transformation, consulting firms are engaged to provide expertise in planning, implementation, and optimization. This force is persistent and is expected to shape the consulting market over the medium to long term.\', \'key_terms\': [\'economic growth\', \'smart cities\', \'urban infrastructure\', \'digital transformation\'], \'mentioned_entities\': [\'Accenture\', \'PwC\', \'KPMG\'], \'raw_findings\': [{\'content\': \'The growth in the forecast period can be attributed to faster economic growth, digital consulting to drive growth, increasing investments in smart cities.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'raw_examples\': [{\'content\': \'Consulting firms are engaged in projects related to smart city planning and digital infrastructure.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'relevant_facts\': [], \'relevant_statistics\': [], \'relevant_data\': [], \'relevant_quotes\': [], \'related_trends\': [\'Smart city consulting\', \'Urban digital transformation\'], \'related_mega_trends\': [\'Urbanization\', \'Digital infrastructure\'], 