ving consulting firms to innovate their service delivery models and revenue structures.\', \'key_terms\': [\'customer satisfaction\', \'modular services\', \'value-oriented revenue model\', \'tailored solutions\'], \'mentioned_entities\': [\'Accenture\', \'PwC\', \'KPMG\'], \'raw_findings\': [{\'content\': \'Major trends in the forecast period include focus on modularization of services, focus on value-oriented revenue model, focus on offering services through virtual firms.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'raw_examples\': [{\'content\': \'Consulting firms are increasingly offering modular and virtual consulting services to meet evolving client needs.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'relevant_facts\': [], \'relevant_statistics\': [], \'relevant_data\': [], \'relevant_quotes\': [], \'related_trends\': [\'Virtual consulting\', \'Modular service delivery\'], \'related_mega_trends\': [\'Personalization\', \'Service innovation\'], \'possible_signals\': [\'Growth in virtual and modular consulting offerings\'], \'possible_structural_shifts\': [\'Shift to client-centric business models\'], \'implications_on_future_of_sector\': [\'Consulting firms must innovate service delivery and pricing models.\', \'Clients will expect more flexible and tailored consulting engagements.\'], \'sources\': [{\'title\': \'Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025\', \'url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'date\': \'January 2025\'}]}, {\'raw_market_force_id\': \'TBRC-2025-006\', \'raw_market_force_name\': \'Artificial Intelligence and Automation in Consulting\', \'r