enabled solutions.\'], \'sources\': [{\'title\': \'Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025\', \'url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'date\': \'January 2025\'}]}, {\'raw_market_force_id\': \'TBRC-2025-002\', \'raw_market_force_name\': \'Globalization and International Expansion\', \'raw_description\': \'Globalization is driving the need for management consulting services that support international expansion, joint ventures, foreign investments, and multinational operations. As companies expand into high-growth regions, they require sophisticated, internationally oriented consulting services. The momentum of globalization is reinforced by rapid internet growth, automation of consultancy processes, and developments in data security. This force is persistent and compels consulting firms to develop cross-border capabilities and partnerships.\', \'key_terms\': [\'globalization\', \'international expansion\', \'joint ventures\', \'foreign investments\', \'multinational companies\', \'cross-border consulting\'], \'mentioned_entities\': [\'Accenture\', \'PwC\', \'KPMG\', \'Bain & Company\'], \'raw_findings\': [{\'content\': \'Many clients of the management consulting services market are expanding globally and thus require more sophisticated and internationally oriented services.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'raw_examples\': [{\'content\': \'Companies are increasingly forming joint ventures with firms in other countries to test the market or acquire established companies to minimize risk.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'relevant_facts\': [{