nd ESG.\', \'Clients will expect guidance on regulatory compliance and sustainable business models.\'], \'sources\': [{\'title\': \'Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025\', \'url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'date\': \'January 2025\'}]}, {\'raw_market_force_id\': \'TBRC-2025-005\', \'raw_market_force_name\': \'Evolving Client Demands and Customer Satisfaction Focus\', \'raw_description\': \'Clients are increasingly demanding value-oriented, modular, and customer-centric consulting services. There is a growing emphasis on customer satisfaction, tailored solutions, and the modularization of consulting offerings. This force is persistent and is driving consulting firms to innovate their service delivery models and revenue structures.\', \'key_terms\': [\'customer satisfaction\', \'modular services\', \'value-oriented revenue model\', \'tailored solutions\'], \'mentioned_entities\': [\'Accenture\', \'PwC\', \'KPMG\'], \'raw_findings\': [{\'content\': \'Major trends in the forecast period include focus on modularization of services, focus on value-oriented revenue model, focus on offering services through virtual firms.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'raw_examples\': [{\'content\': \'Consulting firms are increasingly offering modular and virtual consulting services to meet evolving client needs.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'relevant_facts\': [], \'relevant_statistics\': [], \'relevant_data\': [], \'relevant_quotes\': [], \'related_trends\': [\'Virtual consulting\', \'Modular service delivery\'], \'related_mega_trends\': [\'Personalization\', \'Service innovation\'], \'possible_signals\': [\'Growth in virtual and modular consulting offerings\'], \'possible_structural_shifts\': [\'Shift to client-centric business models\'], \'implications_on_future_of_sector\': [\'Consulting firms must innovate service delivery and pricing models.\', \'Clients will expect more flexible and tailored consulting engagements.\'], \'sources\': [{\'title\': \'Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025\', \'url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'date\': \'January 2025\'}]}, {\'raw_market_force_id\': \'TBRC-2025-006\', \'raw_market_force_name\': \'Artificial Intelligence and Automation in Consulting\', \'raw_description\': \'The integration of artificial intelligence (AI) and automation into consulting processes is transforming how consultants deliver value. These technologies enable faster, more accurate data analysis, streamline workloads, and uncover new business opportunities. The momentum of AI and automation is expected to persist, requiring consulting firms to invest in digital capabilities and adapt their methodologies.\', \'key_terms\': [\'artificial intelligence\', \'automation\', \'data analysis\', \'digital capabilities\'], \'mentioned_entities\': [\'Accenture\', \'PwC\', \'JLL\'], \'raw_findings\': [{\'content\': \'Artificial intelligence (AI) and automation are revolutionizing the way management consultants explore data.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'raw_examples\': [{\'content\': \'JLL leverages an AI analysis system to drastically streamline workloads, analyzing client portfolios that can be made up of anything between 1 and 100,000 properties.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'relevant_facts\': [], \'relevant_statistics\': [], \'relevant_data\': [], \'relevant_quotes\': [], \'related_trends\': [\'AI-driven consulting\', \'Automation in service delivery\'], \'related_mega_trends\': [\'Digital transformation\', \'AI revolution\'], \'possible_signals\': [\'Increased adoption of AI tools in consulting\'], \'possible_structural_shifts\': [\'Transformation of consulting workflows through automation\'], \'implications_on_future_of_sector\': [\'Consulting firms must upskill staff and invest in AI tools.\', \'Clients will expect faster, data-driven insights and recommendations.\'], \'sources\': [{\'title\': \'Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025\', \'url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'date\': \'January 2025\'}]}, {\'raw_market_force_id\': \'TBRC-2025-007\', \'raw_market_force_name\': \'Economic Growth and Investment in Smart Cities\', \'raw_description\': \'Faster economic growth and increasing investments in smart cities are driving demand for management consulting services. As governments and private entities invest in urban infrastructure and digital transformation, consulting firms are engaged to provide expertise in planning, implementation, and optimization. This force is persistent and is expected to shape the consulting market over the medium to long term.\', \'key_terms\': [\'economic growth\', \'smart cities\', \'urban infrastructure\', \'digital transformation\'], \'mentioned_entities\': [\'Accenture\', \'PwC\', \'KPMG\'], \'raw_findings\': [{\'content\': \'The growth in the forecast period can be attributed to faster economic growth, digital consulting to drive growth, increasing investments in smart cities.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\'