any.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'source_text\': None, \'source_name\': \'The Business Research Company\'}], \'relevant_facts\': [], \'relevant_statistics\': [], \'relevant_data\': [], \'relevant_quotes\': [], \'related_trends\': [\'Sustainability consulting\', \'ESG advisory\'], \'related_mega_trends\': [\'Climate change\', \'Sustainable development\'], \'possible_signals\': [\'Growth in environmental consulting practices\'], \'possible_structural_shifts\': [\'Integration of ESG into core consulting offerings\'], \'implications_on_future_of_sector\': [\'Consulting firms must develop expertise in sustainability and ESG.\', \'Clients will expect guidance on regulatory compliance and sustainable business models.\'], \'sources\': [{\'title\': \'Management Consulting Services Global Market Report 2025\', \'url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global-market-report\', \'date\': \'January 2025\'}]}, {\'raw_market_force_id\': \'TBRC-2025-005\', \'raw_market_force_name\': \'Evolving Client Demands and Customer Satisfaction Focus\', \'raw_description\': \'Clients are increasingly demanding value-oriented, modular, and customer-centric consulting services. There is a growing emphasis on customer satisfaction, tailored solutions, and the modularization of consulting offerings. This force is persistent and is driving consulting firms to innovate their service delivery models and revenue structures.\', \'key_terms\': [\'customer satisfaction\', \'modular services\', \'value-oriented revenue model\', \'tailored solutions\'], \'mentioned_entities\': [\'Accenture\', \'PwC\', \'KPMG\'], \'raw_findings\': [{\'content\': \'Major trends in the forecast period include focus on modularization of services, focus on value-oriented revenue model, focus on offering services through virtual firms.\', \'source_url\': \'https://www.thebusinessresearchcompany.com/report/management-consulting-services-global