2025-05-20 09:16:33,979 - INFO -       "implication_title": "Emergence of Cognitive Mesh Organizations: Human–AI–Ecosystem Symbiosis Redefines the Consulting Workforce",
2025-05-20 09:16:33,997 - INFO -       "implication_description": "Building on the rise of hybrid, cross-disciplinary AI-augmented talent models (SOI-005), modular/platform consulting (SOI-001, SOI-002), and distributed global delivery (SOI-003), consulting organizations evolve into 'cognitive mesh' structures: fluid, decentralized webs of human experts, AI agents, and partner ecosystems that assemble and dissolve around client challenges. Roles cease to be static titles—each engagement dynamically orchestrates the optimal blend of human, digital, and partner capacity. Power, learning, and decision authority are shared between human and AI intelligence. Career paths fragment, new psychological/social contracts emerge, and firms compete as accelerators of collective intelligence rather than repositories of expertise. Consulting identity, value, and trust become properties of the mesh, not the node.",
