2025-05-20 09:16:34,032 - INFO -         "name": "Organizational Design Paradigm Shift",
2025-05-20 09:16:34,049 - INFO -         "description": "Decentralized, adaptive, mesh-based organizations displace hierarchical pyramids—blurring workforce, AI, and partner boundaries."
